sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Service
    participant Adapter as Garak Adapter Pod<br/>(K8s Job)
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>localhost HTTP
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines API<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TargetLLM as Target LLM<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant SDGModel as SDG Model<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Simple Mode Flow
    EvalHub->>Adapter: ConfigMap mount /etc/eval-job/spec.json<br/>(K8s RBAC)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JobSpec, resolve benchmark<br/>(deep-merge profile + overrides)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve API keys<br/>(13-step fallback chain)
    Adapter->>TargetLLM: Garak subprocess probes<br/>Bearer API key
    TargetLLM-->>Adapter: Model responses
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse results (JSONL → metrics)
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results callback<br/>localhost HTTP
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Upload OCI artifact<br/>localhost HTTP

    Note over EvalHub,SDGModel: KFP Mode Flow
    EvalHub->>Adapter: ConfigMap mount /etc/eval-job/spec.json<br/>(K8s RBAC)
    Adapter->>KFP: Submit 6-step pipeline<br/>SA token / sidecar proxy
    Note right of KFP: Pipeline Steps:
    KFP->>S3: 1. Validate - upload config<br/>AWS creds (TLS)
    KFP->>S3: 2. Resolve taxonomy<br/>AWS creds (TLS)
    KFP->>SDGModel: 3. SDG generate<br/>SDG API key (TLS)
    SDGModel-->>KFP: Generated prompts
    KFP->>S3: 4. Prepare prompts<br/>AWS creds (TLS)
    KFP->>TargetLLM: 5. Garak scan<br/>Target API key (TLS)
    TargetLLM-->>KFP: Model responses
    KFP->>S3: 5. Upload scan results<br/>AWS creds (TLS)
    KFP->>S3: 6. Write HTML outputs<br/>AWS creds (TLS)

    loop Poll every KFP_POLL_INTERVAL seconds
        Adapter->>KFP: Check pipeline status<br/>SA token / sidecar proxy
        KFP-->>Adapter: Status (running/completed/failed)
    end

    Adapter->>S3: Download results<br/>AWS creds (TLS)
    S3-->>Adapter: Scan results + HTML reports
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse results, redact API keys
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results callback<br/>localhost HTTP
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Upload OCI artifact<br/>localhost HTTP
